metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 158: the BOMB BOO SUPPLY (KINGBOO_REMATCH_gdoc.txt) -- from the fight's start, every SpawnInterval seconds while fewer than MaxOut are out: a black foggy spot and a Bomb Boo rising out of it. SpawnMode Centre (this node's point -- the middle of the arena, for the playtests, as Jaysonn asked) or Random (within ArenaRadius, never nearer Mario than MinFromMario); the floor is found under the point. King Boo's hit clears the field and pauses the supply ClearPause seconds. The Boo's own knobs are on BombBoo.tscn's root; Mario's spin, grab reach and throw on his inspector (SMS Rematch)."
